    "sub_name": "臺灣古典文學專題",
    "sub_ename": "TOPIC ON TAIWANESE  TRANDITINAL LITERATURE  HISTORY",
    "describe_ch": "以臺灣古典文學為範疇，時間涵蓋明鄭、清領、日治至戰後，旨在使學生對於臺灣文學內容有所認知，瞭解臺灣古典文學發展與文化特色，進一步建立獨立思考能力，提出原創性議題。",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses on classical Taiwanese literature.  The period covered includes Ming Dynasty, Ching(Qing) Dynasty, Japanese colonial era and post World War II.  The course intends to familirize students with Taiwanese literature and to understand its history as well as culture.  The objective of the course is to prepare students with analytical skills and creativity.",
